{'symbol': 'GD', 'date': '2022-02-07 16:30:00', 'title': 'GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS AWARDED $229 MILLION U.S. ARMY CONTRACT TO BUILD NEXT GENERATION CRYPTOGRAPHIC KEY LOADER', 'text': 'FAIRFAX, VA., FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0GENERAL DYNAMICS MISSION SYSTEMS ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT WAS AWARDED A CONTRACT BY THE U.S. ARMY TO DEVELOP AND PRODUCE A CERTIFIED HAND-HELD DEVICE TO MANAGE AND TRANSFER CRYPTOGRAPHIC KEY MATERIAL AND MISSION PLANNING DATA.'}